          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya yairamu ati: “Enkikidi engemye ku lulwo, iwe Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, kuba Abaisiraeli baamenha endagaano ye wakola nabo. Baamenhagho alutaari dho, era baita abalanzi bo. Nze zenka, ninze nsigairegho, ate zeena bali kwenda kundhita.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
